Subject: [PATCH 2/2] [CUDA] Add L2 prefetching instructions with optional
 eviction policy (#3490)

* [CUDA] Add L2 prefetching instructions with optional eviction policy

* fix format

* [CUDA] Complete prefetch and prefetchu support with EvictPriority

* [CUDA] Align prefetch eviction policy with string APIs

